WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.201
Frank Fiedler joins me now.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.569
He knew several of the victims.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:03.603
His company,

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.537
Defense Systems,

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:05.238
had conducted

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:07.240
active shooter drills at Covenant School,

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:08.775
and he did a walkthrough of the school

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:09.843
today with officials to help

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.711
try and understand what happened.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:12.679
And I should note, as,

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:13.046
of course,

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.214
you also spent 18 years

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.615
working for the Nashville

00:00:15.615 --> 00:00:16.883
Police Department,

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.585
and their actions, of course, saved

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.521
so many lives in this shooting this week.

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.390
So I do want to ask you about your walk

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.524
through in just a moment.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.725
But first,

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.461
these live pictures of what you're

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:28.862
you know,

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.797
what's happening right now in Nashville

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.632
and talking about the victims.

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.834
I know you knew a few of them

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:36.503
and including

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.637
nine year old William Kinney.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.406
His father, West, is a friend of yours.

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.207
And I know he was out of town

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.843
during the shooting and had texted you.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.778
What more are you able to

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.812
tell us about that?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:49.716
Nothing more than that.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.284
He was concerned about,

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:53.420
obviously, the location of his son

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:54.954
and he knew

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:55.522
we were conducting

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:56.322
training at the school.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.624
He knew I was a former officer

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:57.891
and thought

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.393
I might have some insight into that.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.796
And I did not, unfortunately for him.

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:03.396
And at the time,

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.230
we were actually out of town,

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.698
we were in Memphis, Tennessee,

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:07.400
working with another school

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:08.001
so I couldn't

00:01:08.001 --> 00:01:09.569
get any more information from him.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.138
And tragically,

00:01:12.205 --> 00:01:12.605
his son,

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.139
Will, turned out

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:14.808
to be one of the victims.

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.343
You also knew the head of school,

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:18.845
Catherine Kuntz, and Mike Hill,

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:19.546
the custodian,

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:20.380
because obviously you

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:20.613
you know,

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:22.649
you had had done training at the school.

00:01:22.649 --> 00:01:24.851
What can you tell us about them?

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:27.921
Mike, I met a few times.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.189
I didn't know him well.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.256
Catherine had a very

00:01:30.256 --> 00:01:31.257
good relationship with

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.492
I actually just saw

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:33.093
a couple of months ago,

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.127
I ran into her at the bank

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.231
she was the type of person that knew

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.000
this was a heavy topic and knew

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.001
she had to be very careful

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:42.702
about bringing this

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:43.736
in front of her educators.

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:45.872
But she was also adamant about doing that

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:46.706
because she understood

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.441
the severity of the topic

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.144
and the severity of

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:51.811
the teachers

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:52.846
needing to have the knowledge

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:55.181
of what to do in that situation.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.050
So she actually did her due diligence

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:57.484
so much

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:58.518
that she came and sat in

00:01:58.518 --> 00:01:59.986
on our training at another school

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.055
first to make sure

00:02:02.055 --> 00:02:04.224
it was what she wanted for her staff.

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:06.059
And then we worked very closely together

00:02:06.059 --> 00:02:07.827
to customize

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.662
that training program for this location

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.698
and advise them on some physical security

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:14.300
and teach them what to do in the moment.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.669
And so she was steadfast

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.337
in her commitment

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.071
to doing this

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:19.706
and in her commitment to these kids

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:21.608
and more importantly, her staff

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:22.208
and their ability

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.743
to perform under stress.

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:24.511
And she did

00:02:24.511 --> 00:02:26.913
and I did mention that you did that

00:02:26.913 --> 00:02:27.714
walk through of the school

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.082
today with officials

00:02:29.082 --> 00:02:31.084
and obviously because of her. Right.

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.218
You'd conductive actor

00:02:32.218 --> 00:02:33.219
active shooter drills there

00:02:33.219 --> 00:02:34.087
before because she felt

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:35.088
this was so important.

00:02:36.589 --> 00:02:37.590
We've all now seen the

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.324
video of the shooter

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:39.492
walking through the halls

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:41.961
on the surveillance video

00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:43.263
as you were going through today

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.898
with officials trying to understand

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:46.032
what happened.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:47.200
What what did you see?

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:48.935
What stood out to you

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.472
Well, a lot of it I can't talk about

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:53.540
because it's still an open

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.742
homicide investigation.

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:57.510
I will say this.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:59.812
I want to make this clear to this story.

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:00.647
You know,

00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:01.614
the whole story here

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.650
is about these teachers.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.651
People are talking about the training

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:05.185
we did with them.

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:07.020
And yes, training is important.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.755
But I wasn't here on Monday.

00:03:08.755 --> 00:03:10.423
They were here right.

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.292
Their ability to execute

00:03:12.292 --> 00:03:13.593
literally flawlessly

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:14.594
under that amount of stress

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.095
while somebody is trying to murder them

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.297
and their children.

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.932
That is what made the difference here.

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:21.367
And that is that, you know,

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.937
these teachers are the reason those kids

00:03:23.937 --> 00:03:25.371
went home to their families.

00:03:26.472 --> 00:03:26.873
Again, the

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:27.774
training is important,

00:03:27.774 --> 00:03:29.342
but we weren't the ones executing it

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:31.044
in the moment. They were.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.312
I will also tell you from the walk

00:03:32.312 --> 00:03:32.745
through that

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:34.447
the only victims

00:03:34.447 --> 00:03:35.014
the shooter

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:37.150
was able to get to were victims

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.918
that were stuck in some sort of open area

00:03:38.918 --> 00:03:40.320
or hallway.

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:41.221
Everyone else was.

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.323
Several were able to evacuate safely.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.557
The ones that couldn't do that

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.559
safely did exactly what they were taught

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:47.126
and trained to do,

00:03:47.126 --> 00:03:47.961
and that was lock down

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:49.529
and fortify their position.

00:03:49.529 --> 00:03:50.730
They did that.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.164
The shooter

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:52.498
fired multiple rounds

00:03:52.498 --> 00:03:54.534
into several classrooms

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.136
and was not able to hit

00:03:57.136 --> 00:03:58.605
any of the victims

00:03:58.605 --> 00:03:59.572
in those classrooms

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:00.406
because the teachers

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.774
knew exactly what to do,

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.042
how to fortify their doors

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:03.343
and where

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:04.811
to place their children in those rooms.

00:04:04.811 --> 00:04:06.412
So I just want to be clear that

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.548
that this story needs to be about them.

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:08.881
Well, it's

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.216
pretty incredible that they did that.

00:04:10.216 --> 00:04:11.851
I mean, it's not it's

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:12.752
not their job, right?

00:04:12.752 --> 00:04:13.753
They're not there to do that.

00:04:13.753 --> 00:04:14.854
And that they did that and did it

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.289
right and saved all those lives.

00:04:16.289 --> 00:04:16.789
I mean, the horror

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:17.724
and the tragedy of the people

00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:18.691
who are in open spaces

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:20.193
and I know your friend Catherine,

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:20.693
you know,

00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:21.427
it appears

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:22.562
may have run towards the shooter

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:24.130
to try to stop

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:25.498
to try to stop it,

00:04:25.498 --> 00:04:26.432
but that so many lives

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:27.967
were saved despite, as you say,

00:04:27.967 --> 00:04:30.103
live rounds being fired into classrooms

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.704
that no one in those classrooms died.

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:34.173
You know, when we saw the shooter

00:04:34.173 --> 00:04:35.908
initially go into the school by,

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:36.242
you know,

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:37.310
shooting at those glass doors

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.412
and going in right sort of

00:04:39.412 --> 00:04:41.848
kamikaze style,

00:04:41.848 --> 00:04:43.916
when when you heard about this

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:45.184
and you you knew Katherine,

00:04:45.184 --> 00:04:46.486
you had been in that school.

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:47.487
You had trained

00:04:47.487 --> 00:04:50.423
what actually went through your mind

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.726
So when we were in

00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:54.494
Memphis assessing

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:57.063
this of this other school,

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:58.765
because we still have such a

00:04:58.765 --> 00:04:59.432
deep connection

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:00.300
to the police department,

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.601
we were getting

00:05:01.601 --> 00:05:03.736
pretty UP-TO-DATE information.

00:05:03.736 --> 00:05:04.771
And,

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:07.640
you know, at first it was very surreal.

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:07.974
You know,

00:05:07.974 --> 00:05:09.642
I knew because of what I do for a living

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:11.778
and because of our company growth,

00:05:11.778 --> 00:05:13.079
I kind of knew eventually

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:14.547
that it was going to happen

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:15.715
at one of the facilities

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:16.449
or one of the schools

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:17.950
or whatever that we had trained.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:19.385
But it's still never.

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:21.287
It's still very surreal right now

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:22.055
and today

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:24.624
and very tough, I'll say.

00:05:24.624 --> 00:05:24.891
You know,

00:05:24.891 --> 00:05:26.225
because we

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:27.794
we walked that crime scene,

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:28.828
even though it was very tough.

00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:29.462
It is important

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:31.164
for us to learn from these events

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:33.866
and get better moving forward.

00:05:33.866 --> 00:05:36.002
But at the same time,

00:05:36.002 --> 00:05:38.304
I felt confident that the people here,

00:05:38.304 --> 00:05:39.539
because of Catherine's commitment,

00:05:39.539 --> 00:05:41.040
to this program,

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:41.908
knew what to do

00:05:41.908 --> 00:05:44.844
and would execute flawlessly.

00:05:44.844 --> 00:05:46.045
I'm just proud they did.

00:05:46.045 --> 00:05:46.779
But I really

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:48.581
I really felt like they would

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:49.982
because every one of these people

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.317
took this training seriously.

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:52.919
And we had

00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:54.887
extreme buy in from every faculty

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:55.955
and staff member.

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:56.989
Brink, thank you very much.

00:05:56.989 --> 00:05:59.025
I appreciate your time.

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:01.260
Thank you for having me.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.295
All right. Thank you.

00:06:02.295 --> 00:06:03.229
And I hope so many here

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:04.697
his words that with all that training

00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:06.232
and he actually knew that at some point

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:07.233
it would happen in a school

00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:07.967
that he had trained

00:06:07.967 --> 00:06:09.168
just to even think about that,

00:06:09.168 --> 00:06:10.069
that that's the reality

00:06:10.069 --> 00:06:11.204
that we're living in this country

00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:14.207
as a very hard, hard to process.

